:"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-01-05T15:41:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T17:03:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101157","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101157","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101157.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101157.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"We'll start by creating a new scene and attaching a non-tool script, then connect the `ready` signal to this script's method as shown here, and check the `deferred` option:\r\n![Godot_v4 4-dev6_win64_2Q9oRKYIEt](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9b8864a-cdf1-481a-ad12-f77d18009f61)\r\n\r\nSave & close this scene, reopen it and we get a error message:\r\n![Godot_v4 4-dev6_win64_qT66E40PkG](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37c8fd30-f504-4a25-994c-14d525cb86be)\r\n\r\n**Cause analysis:**\r\nIn previous implementations, only signals that did not have `deferred` enabled were checked to ensure that non-toolscript method calls were not triggered in the `editor_hint` state.\r\n\r\nBy this PR, the timing of this check has been moved forward so that non-toolscript method calls can be avoided even in `deferred` enabled signal connections.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101157/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101157/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}